{{Top}}
'''Toby Briton''' was one of the guests invited to an upcoming dinner for the governor of [[Hanna City|Hanna]], hosted by [[Senator]] [[Mon Mothma]] and her husband [[Perrin Fertha]].<ref name="Aldhani">{{Andor|Aldhani (episode)}}</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
The character's name seems to be a reference to [[Toby Britton]], who worked as a supervising art director on the television series ''[[Star Wars: Andor]]''.<ref name="Aldhani" />

